---
import {recoveryPaths} from './model.mjs';
---
<figure class="dc-figure" aria-labelledby="dc-recovery-title" data-recovery>
  <figcaption id="dc-recovery-title"><span class="dc-number">Figure 3</span> What evidence can recovery reach?</figcaption>
  <div class="dc-panel">
    <label class="dc-choice">Failure case <select data-case>{Object.entries(recoveryPaths).map(([value,path])=><option value={value}>{path.label}</option>)}</select></label>
    <p class="dc-process" data-process data-live>Coordinator unavailable</p>
    <div class="dc-evidence">
      <p class="dc-record-label">Authoritative decision state</p>
      <div class="dc-voters" data-voters hidden>{['D1','D2','D3'].map((name,i)=><div><b>{name}</b><strong data-voter={i} data-live>Earlier state</strong></div>)}</div>
      <p data-evidence data-live>Coordinator log inaccessible</p>
    </div>
    <div class="dc-recovery-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
    <div class="dc-pair dc-participants">
      <div><b>A · order + lines</b><strong data-a data-live>PREPARED</strong></div>
      <div><b>P · shared stock</b><strong data-p data-live>PREPARED</strong></div>
    </div>
    <p class="dc-explanation" data-explanation data-live aria-live="polite">{recoveryPaths.classic.steps[0].explanation}</p>
    <div class="dc-hold" data-hold aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
    <div class="dc-controls" role="group" aria-label="Figure 3 playback"><button type="button" data-play>Play</button><button type="button" data-back>Back</button><button type="button" data-next>Next</button><button type="button" data-reset>Reset</button><span data-step>1 / 4</span></div>
  </div>
  <p class="dc-caption" data-caption data-live>{recoveryPaths.classic.caption}</p>
  <p class="dc-caption">The replicated cases assume fixed membership, non-malicious processes, durable storage and an agreement protocol that preserves final decisions across leadership changes. D1–D3 copy decision state, not three separate purchase participants. Recovery and notification delays are unspecified.</p>
  <details class="dc-alternative"><summary>All recovery cases as text</summary>{Object.values(recoveryPaths).map(path=><div><p><b>{path.label}</b></p><ol>{path.steps.map(s=><li>{s.explanation}</li>)}</ol></div>)}</details>
</figure>
<script>
  import {stepper} from '../figures/stepper.mjs';
  import {recoveryPaths} from './model.mjs';
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-recovery]').forEach(root=>{
    const select=root.querySelector('[data-case]');
    const draw=(index)=>{
      const path=recoveryPaths[select.value];
      const stage=path.steps[index];
      for(const key of ['process','a','p','evidence','explanation'])root.querySelector(`[data-${key}]`).textContent=stage[key];
      root.querySelector('[data-voters]').hidden=stage.voters.length===0;
      root.querySelectorAll('[data-voter]').forEach((n,i)=>{n.textContent=stage.voters[i]||'';n.parentElement.dataset.unavailable=String(stage.voters[i]==='Unavailable');});
      root.querySelector('[data-caption]').textContent=path.caption;
    };
    const player=stepper(root,{steps:()=>recoveryPaths[select.value].steps.length,draw});
    select.addEventListener('change',()=>{root.querySelector('[data-reset]').click();player.render();});
  });
</script>
